# Vulnerabilities the image scans may skip for a short time (ADR 0041).
#
# Only for a fixable HIGH or CRITICAL finding in a base image when no allowed
# base tag is clean yet (the daily Image scan issue says which are). Each entry
# is a comment line with the tracking issue's URL, then the id and an expiry
# at most 30 days ahead:
#
#   # https://github.com/thedude459/open-garden/issues/123
#   CVE-2026-123456 exp:2026-12-20
#
# Once the date passes, the scan fails on it again. CI checks every entry
# (node scripts/ci/trivyignore-check.js check).
